                         "verticalAlign":  "top",
                         "containerId":  null,
                         "originalText":  "Celebrity rule: authors with \u003e ~1M followers are NOT fanned out; their recent tweets are pulled and merged at read time.\nRead-your-writes: the Timeline Service also merges my own latest tweets.\nInactive users (30+ days) are skipped in fan-out; their timeline is rebuilt on login.\nNumbers: 60k timeline reads/s peak, 3k tweets/s peak, ~600k fan-out writes/s peak, timeline cache ~3 TB.",
